.git
.gitignore
.github
.circleci
node_modules
.nuxt
.output
# The rooted patterns above miss the layer copies (lat/, modtools-lat/). A
# host-side build leaking lat/.output or modtools-lat/.output into the image
# makes the prod container skip its env-aware first-start build and serve the
# wrong (baked) API URLs. Match them at any depth. (Restored from upstream.)
**/node_modules
**/.nuxt
**/.output
dist
.env
.env.*
logs
*.log
coverage
monocart-report
playwright-report
test-results
.vitest
.vscode
.idea
*.spec.js
*.md
docs
.DS_Store
Dockerfile
build-info
swagger/
docker-compose*.yml
scripts/
*.swp
*.swo